WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.302
-Now, we all love our pets,

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:04.838
and every pet owner thinks
that their pet is the best.

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:06.806
Well, I wanted to see
if that was true,

00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:09.142
so it's time for, "Why is Your
Pet Better Than Me?"

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:10.310
Here we go.
♪♪

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:12.612
-♪ Why is your
pet better than me? ♪

00:00:12.612 --> 00:00:15.414
♪ Better than me ♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:15.414 --> 00:00:17.917
-Alright, let's meet
our first pet.

00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:19.151
Hello there.

00:00:19.151 --> 00:00:22.288
Hey, what's your name,
and where are you from?

00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:25.058
-Hello. I'm Florian,
and I'm from Germany.

00:00:25.058 --> 00:00:26.292
Morty, come.

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:27.927
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:29.895
-Whoa!

00:00:29.895 --> 00:00:31.231
Whoa! I love that already.

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:32.599
I love -- All the way
from Germany.

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:34.901
Thank you so much
for being on our show.

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:36.202
I love that.

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:39.138
Already, I can see why
your pet is better than me.

00:00:39.138 --> 00:00:41.874
What is the name of your dog?
What kind of dog is that?

00:00:41.874 --> 00:00:45.211 line:0%
-He's a 5-year-old
Australian shepherd.

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:47.680 line:0%
-I love those.
-And, yeah, he's pretty awesome.

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:49.849 line:0%
-What -- Is that his talent?
What is his talent?

00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:52.818
-His talent is, he got all
the trust in the world for me,

00:00:52.818 --> 00:00:56.956
and he even does
a trust fall with me.

00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:58.591
-Oh, my gosh.

00:00:58.591 --> 00:01:01.194
Florian, what is
your dog's name again?

00:01:01.194 --> 00:01:03.363
-Morty.
-Yeah, Morty.

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:06.232
Alright, can we see Morty --

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:08.467
Can we see Morty do
a trust fall with you?

00:01:08.467 --> 00:01:10.670
This is hilarious.
-Sure.

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:12.939
-Oh, my gosh.
[ Drumroll ]

00:01:12.939 --> 00:01:16.141
Wow!
Right there is amazing, huh?

00:01:16.141 --> 00:01:18.578
Oh, my gosh. Be careful, Morty.

00:01:19.846 --> 00:01:21.181
-Ready?

00:01:23.449 --> 00:01:25.151
-Oh, my gosh.

00:01:26.419 --> 00:01:28.154
[ Cheers and applause ]
Wow!

00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:30.890
Whew! Oh, my gosh!

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:33.826
Wow! Morty!

00:01:33.826 --> 00:01:36.095
Great job, Morty.

00:01:36.095 --> 00:01:38.564
You scored right there, buddy.
Thanks for coming on the show.

00:01:38.564 --> 00:01:39.699
All the way from Germany.
That was great.

00:01:39.699 --> 00:01:40.700
-Thank you.

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.601
-Let's meet our next pet
right here.

00:01:42.601 --> 00:01:44.303
Oh, wow!
[ Laughs ]

00:01:44.303 --> 00:01:46.839
Well, it must be
sunny where you are.

00:01:46.839 --> 00:01:50.142
Hello. What is your name,
and where are you from?

00:01:50.142 --> 00:01:52.111 line:0%
-My name is Jess.
This is Cooper.

00:01:52.111 --> 00:01:54.580 line:0%
And we're from Mission Viejo,
California.

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:57.283 line:0%
-Ah! Mission Viejo.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:57.283 --> 00:02:00.887
-Yeah.
-I love Cooper's sunglasses.

00:02:00.887 --> 00:02:04.824
Can you tell me,
why is Cooper better than me?

00:02:04.824 --> 00:02:08.127
-Cooper can make
a really good silly face.

00:02:08.127 --> 00:02:09.595
-Oh, really?
Oh, I'd love to see --

00:02:09.595 --> 00:02:11.331
Now -- [ Laughs ]

00:02:11.331 --> 00:02:13.800
He's really cute.
He can make a silly face.

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:15.668
Alright, Cooper, let's see this.

00:02:15.668 --> 00:02:17.437
Roots, can we get
a drumroll, please?

00:02:17.437 --> 00:02:18.505
[ Drumroll ]

00:02:18.505 --> 00:02:19.972
-Okay, Cooper,
on the count of three,

00:02:19.972 --> 00:02:21.941
do your best silly face, okay?

00:02:21.941 --> 00:02:25.411
One, two, three.

00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:29.215
-[ Laughs ]
♪♪

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:31.550
I love it.
No, no, that's awesome.

00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:33.319
I love you and I love Cooper.

00:02:33.319 --> 00:02:35.121
Thank you, Jess,
for bringing him on the show.

00:02:35.121 --> 00:02:38.891
Hey, Cooper. Good doggy.
Good doggy. Hi, buddy.

00:02:38.891 --> 00:02:42.027
Oh, yeah, good job.
Good job, buddy.

00:02:42.027 --> 00:02:43.262
Let's meet our
next pet over here.

00:02:43.262 --> 00:02:46.799
Hello. What is your name,
and where are you from?

00:02:46.799 --> 00:02:50.603
-Hey. My name is Allison Flake,
and I'm from Houston, Texas.

00:02:50.603 --> 00:02:54.007
-Ah, hey, welcome.
Thank you very much.

00:02:54.007 --> 00:02:55.207
We love Houston.

00:02:55.207 --> 00:02:57.543
Allison,
what is your pet's name?

00:02:57.543 --> 00:03:00.413 line:0%
-His name is Astro,
for the Houston Astros.

00:03:00.413 --> 00:03:03.750 line:0%
-There you go. Astro.
Now, what is Astro's talent?

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:07.553
-So, he can catch
foam golf balls.

00:03:07.553 --> 00:03:10.657
-Alright, I got to see this
golf-ball action here.

00:03:10.657 --> 00:03:11.757
I love golf.

00:03:11.757 --> 00:03:13.526
Roots, can we get
a little music here?

00:03:13.526 --> 00:03:14.694
♪♪

00:03:14.694 --> 00:03:16.229
-Astro, you ready?
-Alright, bud.

00:03:16.229 --> 00:03:17.230
-Come on.

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:19.065
-He's just kind of
sitting there.

00:03:22.134 --> 00:03:23.303
[ Laughs ]

00:03:26.472 --> 00:03:28.541
-Are you ready? Come on.

00:03:28.541 --> 00:03:31.344
I like this. Watch this.

00:03:31.877 --> 00:03:34.313
[ Laughs ]

00:03:34.313 --> 00:03:36.716
I love this cat.

00:03:36.716 --> 00:03:38.951
-More? Come on, come on.
-You ready, bud?

00:03:38.951 --> 00:03:40.386
-Ready?

00:03:41.987 --> 00:03:44.023
-Yes! 3 for 3!

00:03:44.023 --> 00:03:45.425
♪♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:45.425 --> 00:03:47.560
Astro!

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:50.162
I love that. Good job, Astro.

00:03:50.162 --> 00:03:52.064
Allison, thank you so much
for bringing him on.

00:03:52.064 --> 00:03:54.033
I really appreciate it.
Good job.

00:03:54.033 --> 00:03:56.535
[ Cheers and applause ]
Let's meet our last pet here.

00:03:56.535 --> 00:04:00.773
Hello. What is your name,
and where are you from?

00:04:00.773 --> 00:04:02.608
-Hello. My name is
Lindsey Wadden,

00:04:02.608 --> 00:04:05.111
and we are from Maple Ridge
in Canada.

00:04:05.111 --> 00:04:06.779
-Oh, hey!

00:04:06.779 --> 00:04:08.447
Thank you so much, Lindsey.

00:04:08.447 --> 00:04:10.583
Now, I think I have an idea
what's going to happen,

00:04:10.583 --> 00:04:13.285
but who is there with you,
and what kind of dog is that?

00:04:13.285 --> 00:04:17.323 line:0%
-This is Ollie, and he is a
7-year-old border collie.

00:04:17.323 --> 00:04:18.724 line:0%
Say hi.
-Oh, my gosh.

00:04:18.724 --> 00:04:21.260
Say hi. That's cute already.
Oh, my gosh.

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:24.063
Now, don't even tell me
the dog is going to play Jenga.

00:04:24.063 --> 00:04:25.697
Is that true?

00:04:25.697 --> 00:04:28.468
-Yeah, he's going to try.

00:04:28.468 --> 00:04:30.269
-This is amazing.
I would love to see this happen.

00:04:30.269 --> 00:04:31.704
And this just happens?

00:04:31.704 --> 00:04:35.541
You have game night, and he just
comes over and starts playing?

00:04:35.541 --> 00:04:37.743
-Yeah, we do.
-Yeah.

00:04:37.743 --> 00:04:38.944
I love this. Alright.
-Ready?

00:04:38.944 --> 00:04:41.581
-Roots, could we maybe
get a drumroll, maybe?

00:04:41.581 --> 00:04:44.317
[ Drumroll ]

00:04:44.317 --> 00:04:46.886
-Okay. Okay, wait.

00:04:46.886 --> 00:04:50.022
Slow it down.
Slow it down.

00:04:50.022 --> 00:04:51.257
-Do you want to
stick that one -- Ooh!

00:04:51.257 --> 00:04:53.158
-Gentle. Yep, that one.

00:04:53.158 --> 00:04:56.228
Get it. Get it.

00:04:56.228 --> 00:04:57.396
Good boy.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:57.396 --> 00:05:00.499
-Yes! Yes!

00:05:00.499 --> 00:05:03.402
Yes! Good job!

00:05:03.402 --> 00:05:07.106
Ollie, great job!
-Good job!

00:05:07.106 --> 00:05:09.308
-Great job to all of
our talented pets.

00:05:09.308 --> 00:05:11.076
If you think you have a pet
that is better than me,

00:05:11.076 --> 00:05:12.278
I want to see it.

00:05:12.278 --> 00:05:15.782 line:0%
Go to tonightshow.com/
whyisyourpetbetterthanme,

00:05:15.782 --> 00:05:17.349 line:0%
